### CQRS (Command Query Responsibility Segregation)

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

```mermaid
block-beta
columns 1
  block:CO
    A["Command Operations
(insert/update/delete)"]
    CD[("Command DB")]
  end
  space
  block:QO
    B["Query Operations
(read/search/scan)"]
    QD[("Query DB")]
  end
  A --> CD 
  B --> QD
  QD --> CD
```

