#### More use cases

* Notifications
* Mails
* Generate reports (csv/pdf documents)

<!-- livebook:{"break_markdown":true} -->

#### Pros

* Simplifying complex domain modeling
* Provide simple tools to handle events and projections
* Separation of conserns (Data model do not leak from one use case to another)

#### Cons

* Demands a rich understanding of your domains
* Immutable history
* Complexiting (Learning Curve)
* Managing consistency in projections
* Event Replay (for large event stores)
* Not applicable to existing applications

#### Bonus Topics

* Data security (GDPR)
* Authorization
* Historic State (Time Travel)

